    {"canonical": "逢井", "render": "逢井", "category": "person_name_or_form", "status": "project_locked", "first_recorded_game": "kibu1", "note": "读音 アイ（Ai），Genma 游戏编剧，飞鸟望美男友。不得与网名アイビス无证据归并。", "source_refs": ["kibu1/characters/12", "kibu2/characters/12", "kibu3/characters/12", "kibu4/characters/12"]},
    {"canonical": "飛鳥望美", "render": "飞鸟望美", "aliases": ["望美"], "category": "person_name_or_form", "status": "project_locked", "first_recorded_game": "kibu1", "note": "读音 アスカ ノゾミ（Asuka Nozomi），委托寻找网友狭川美妮，逢井女友。", "source_refs": ["kibu1/characters/13", "kibu2/characters/13", "kibu3/characters/13", "kibu4/characters/13"]},
    {"canonical": "狭川美弐", "render": "狭川美妮", "aliases": ["美弐"], "category": "person_name_or_form", "status": "project_locked", "first_recorded_game": "kibu1", "note": "读音 サガワ ミニ（Sagawa Mini）。真实独立人物，优秀程序员、雪人系统开发者。笠见由纪乃冒用其姓名，绝不能把二人合并。", "source_refs": ["kibu1/characters/14", "kibu2/characters/14", "kibu3/characters/14", "kibu4/characters/14"]},
    {"canonical": "笠見由紀乃", "render": "笠见由纪乃", "aliases": ["由紀乃"], "category": "person_name_or_form", "status": "project_locked", "first_recorded_game": "kibu1", "note": "22岁女职员，村崎洋才的亲妹妹，后由笠见家收养。冒用狭川美妮身份；网游角色みに。笠見姓单独出现需按上下文识别她或养父，故不放入人物 aliases。", "source_refs": ["kibu1/characters/15", "kibu2/characters/15", "kibu3/characters/15", "kibu4/characters/15"]},
    {"canonical": "笠見伝次郎", "render": "笠见传次郎", "aliases": ["伝次郎"], "category": "person_name_or_form", "status": "project_locked", "first_recorded_game": "kibu1", "note": "笠见由纪乃养父，冒充山王丸房东。与山王丸豪吉是不同人物，绝不能归并。", "source_refs": ["kibu1/characters/16", "kibu2/characters/16", "kibu3/characters/16", "kibu4/characters/16"]},
    {"canonical": "山王丸豪吉", "render": "山王丸豪吉", "aliases": ["山王丸"], "category": "person_name_or_form", "status": "project_locked", "first_recorded_game": "kibu1", "note": "真正房东；scn9 [6067-6074] 揭示正在国外旅行。早期标注为山王丸的角色实际由笠见传次郎冒充，译文须保留当时称呼，不提前剧透。", "source_refs": ["kibu1/characters/17", "kibu2/characters/17", "kibu3/characters/17", "kibu4/characters/17"]},
    {"canonical": "ヴィオレ", "render": "维奥莱", "aliases": ["ヴィオ"], "category": "person_name_or_form", "status": "project_locked", "first_recorded_game": "kibu1", "note": "村崎的网游账号，简称维奥；scn3 [3238-3240] 明说法语紫色。账号会由不同人登录，不能把账号显示名替换成村崎。", "source_refs": ["kibu1/characters/18", "kibu2/characters/18", "kibu3/characters/18", "kibu4/characters/18"]},
